# SE-008: Crystallise nitrate selectively from a mixed-salt solution
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100g @ 70C
add v1 KNO3 50g
add v1 NaCl 5g
heat v1 10kJ
measure v1 thermometer
inspect v1
cool v1 20kJ
measure v1 thermometer
new
filter v1 v2
inspect
